{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>בפשע</b> — On account of the transgression of his lips a man of evil is ensnared, as in: \"the mouth of a fool is ruin to him\" (Proverbs 13:3)." "<b>ומצרה יצא צדיק</b> — He escapes through his righteousness, as in: \"Many are the troubles of the righteous, and from them all YHWH delivers him\" (Psalms 34:20)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:21.466997729Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}